//! P19 part B: `config/launch.json` (generated by tools/launch-config) is loaded through the REAL `create_market` and
//! `create_ruleset` instructions of the program on a fresh harness, in the deploy order of handover/launch-config.md (all
//! markets in id order, then rule set v1). The chain's accounts must be exactly the file. Then an account is opened under that
//! rule set and a small honest history is traded on three of the launch markets (one GMX source, one Hyperliquid index, one
//! Hyperliquid stock) through the reference evaluator, every batch posted to the real program, and the public verifier says VALID.
mod common;

